# SentinelForge (OmniChatX / UAIS-V2)

Offline-first multimodal AI platform: Data Engineering + ML Engineering + AI Engineering.

## Quickstart (local)
- Create venv, install deps
- Start API (FastAPI)
- Optionally start UI (Streamlit)

## Architecture
- src/api: routers
- src/services: business logic
- src/data_eng: ingestion/validation/splits/features
- src/ml: trainers/eval/registry/serving
- src/ai: agent router + RAG
- src/ops: metrics/health/readiness

